## Why This Is Asked
Tests cross-system cache invalidation strategies across Redis and Memcached with production-grade considerations.

## Key Concepts
- Cross-cache invalidation across backends
- Version stamping and invalidation streams
- Redis Lua atomicity
- Memcached revalidation via version check
- Cache stampede avoidance

